 * motorOnOff(motor, on)
 *
 * PARAMETERS: (">" input, "!" modified, "<" output)
 * (>) motor (int)          Motor to switch
 * (>) on (BOOL)            Turn on if TRUE, off otherwise
 *
 * FUNCTION VALUE:
 * (int) Returns VME_OK (0) or VME_ERROR (1) as status
 *
 * PURPOSE:
 * Turn motor on or off
 *
 * DESCRIPTION:
 * Turns motor on or off.  Does status checking of cabling and controller
 * faults before powering the motor on.  The low level BUSY flag is
 * set and cleared in this routine.
 *
 * EXTERNAL VARIABLES:
