/*
 * Copyright 2001 Association of Universities for Research in Astronomy, Inc.
 * See the file COPYRIGHT for more details.
 *
 * FILENAME:
 * motors.c
 *
 * FUNCTION NAME(S):
 *  abortMotor   -   Abort motor motion 
 *  chargeLimit   -   Move quickly to a switch 
 *  checkLimit   -   Check for limit switch 
 *  checkParked   -   Check to see if parked 
 *  datum   -   Datum the motor 
 *  findLimit   -   Find a limit (top level call) 
 *  findTheLimit   -   Find a limit 
 *  finishMotorConfig   -   Finish motor configuration 
 *  getMdStatus   -   Determine motor status 
 *  goToPos   -   Move to position, remove backlash  
 *  gotoLimit   -   Move to a limit (BINARY only) 
 *  initMotors   -   Initialize motor software and hardware 
 *  isBusy   -    
 *  isInError   -   Returns the motor's ERROR condition. 
 *  isParked   -   Checks to see if motor is parked. 
 *  mErrMsg   -   Record error message 
 *  motorCreep   -   Creep to a switch position 
 *  motorHealthTree   -   Calculates system health 
 *  motorOff   -   Turns motor off 
 *  motorOn   -   Turns on motor 
 *  motorOnOff   -   Turn motor on or off 
 *  motorPos   -   Move directly to a given motor position 
 *  motorSteps   -   Move motor with relative motion 
 *  motorTask   -   Task to move a motor. 
 *  motorTimeout   -   Calculate minimum timeout 
 *  moveOneMotor   -   Dispatch a motor command 
 *  noWait   -   Send motor command and return immediately 
 *  park   -   Park a motor 
 *  position   -   Move motor to a given position 
 *  probeLimSwitch   -   Move slowly into a limit. 
 *  resetFault   -   Reset the motor's fault line 
 *  sendToMotorDriver   -   Send command to motor controller 
 *  setHome   -   Locate home switch 
 *  setupMotor   -   Configure a motor with default values. 
 *  tellPV   -   Determine position and velocity 
 *  testOMSCards   -   Test the OMS cards 
 *  waitFor   -   Issue motor command 
 *
